## polite vs assertive

| Role | Behaviour | Use for |
|------|-----------|---------|
| `status` / `polite` | Announced when the user is idle | "Saved", "Copied" |
| `alert` / `assertive` | Interrupts immediately | Errors, failures |

Making everything assertive is hostile — it interrupts whatever the user was reading.

