## Follow-ups

| Question | Answer |
|----------|--------|
| Smooth animation? | `requestAnimationFrame` instead of `setInterval` — syncs to paint |
| Background tab? | Timestamps make it self-correcting; also listen for `visibilitychange` |
| Survive a refresh? | Persist the target timestamp, not the remaining time |
| Server time? | Fetch the server's clock once and store the offset — client clocks are wrong |
| Accessibility? | `aria-live="polite"` but only announce at intervals, not every second |

