## Follow-ups

**"Multi-select filters?"** Repeat the key — `?tag=react&tag=hooks` — and read with `searchParams.getAll('tag')`.

**"Very long URLs?"** Omit defaults (as above). If it is still unmanageable, store a saved-search id server-side and put that in the URL.

**"Validation?"** Parse the params with a Zod schema and fall back to defaults — users edit URLs, and `?page=abc` should not crash the page.
